    "description": {
      "value": "<p>As a Magic action, you can expend one use of your Channel Divinity to conjure spectral vines around nearby creatures. Each creature of your choice you can see within 15 feet of you must succeed on a Strength saving throw or have the Restrained condition for 1 minute, repeating the save at the end of each of its turns and ending the effect on a success.</p>",
